  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "影像與文學",
    "sub_ename": "IMAGE AND TEXT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程試圖引導學生探索與分析影像與文學文本之間的關係，深入了解影像如何傳達思想，以及影像與文字如何在作品中相互補充或矛盾。為了使內容多樣化，教材包括書面和多媒體形式的材料，例如書籍、繪本、海報、動畫、電影等。",
    "describe_eh": "This course attempts to guide students to explore and analyze the relationship between images and literary texts so that they can learn how images convey thought and how images and words reinforce or contradict one another in a work. In order to diversify the content, teaching materials include written and multimedia forms such as books, picture books, posters, animations, movies, etc.",
